{
  "an11.11:0.1": "Numbered Discourses 11.11 ",
  "an11.11:0.2": "2. Recollection ",
  "an11.11:0.3": "With Mahānāma (1st) ",
  "an11.11:1.1": "At one time the Buddha was staying in the land of the Sakyans, near Kapilavatthu in the Banyan Tree Monastery. ",
  "an11.11:1.2": "At that time several mendicants were making a robe for the Buddha, thinking that ",
  "an11.11:1.3": "when his robe was finished and the three months of the rains residence had passed the Buddha would set out wandering. ",
  "an11.11:1.4": "Mahānāma the Sakyan heard about this. ",
  "an11.11:1.5": "",
  "an11.11:1.6": "",
  "an11.11:2.1": "He went up to the Buddha, bowed, sat down to one side, and said to him: ",
  "an11.11:2.2": "“Sir, I have heard that ",
  "an11.11:2.3": "several mendicants are making a robe for the Buddha, thinking that ",
  "an11.11:2.4": "when his robe was finished and the three months of the rains residence had passed the Buddha would set out wandering. ",
  "an11.11:2.5": "Now, we spend our life in various ways. Which of these should we practice?” ",
  "an11.11:3.1": "“Good, good, Mahānāma! ",
  "an11.11:3.2": "It’s appropriate that gentlemen such as you come to me and ask: ",
  "an11.11:3.3": "‘We spend our life in various ways. Which of these should we practice?’ ",
  "an11.11:3.4": "The faithful succeed, not the faithless. ",
  "an11.11:3.5": "The energetic succeed, not the lazy. ",
  "an11.11:3.6": "The mindful succeed, not the unmindful. ",
  "an11.11:3.7": "Those with immersion succeed, not 